  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Training of trainers and training materials young dairy farmers Nakuru</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to contribute to the development of a business incubation programme for young dairy farmers and dairy students  making the farm professional and running the farm as a business after graduation in Nakuru county.The focus is the training of Kenyan trainers on business incubation (technical, managerial and entrepreneurial aspects inclusive guiding and coaching the students in developing their business plan). And the contextualizing of the Dutch and Kenyan existing materials, 10 modules on dairy farm management and economics.</narrative>
  </description>
